  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catalysing a transformative model for circularity through 9R`s in Aqaba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project seeks to contribute to the establishment of a Creative Circular Economy Centre (CCEC) in Aqaba city based on the 9Rs and according to the recommended actions of the green strategies at the national level targeting the creation of green jobs, reduction of carbon emissions and ensuring the identification of the most appropriate business model for public-private partnership, introducing this center as a role model to be replicated in other cities in Jordan.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
